From: Prabhsimran Singh <prabhsimrans@nvidia.com>
Subject: llama: split decode into prepare and launch

llama_decode_prepare runs batch init, memory apply, graph build and alloc and
the input upload while the previous decode is still on the GPU (its outputs
stay readable); llama_decode_launch sets the token ids and computes. For
single-ubatch token batches.

Upstream: not planned.

